msgid "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.decomposition_rate`"
msgstr "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.decomposition_rate`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
msgid "No soil processes over water. The value is a non-negative multiplier of the reference soil process rate (the other land-use classes declare it within [0.1, 1.3]); a negative factor would reverse the process, so the lower bound is 0."
msgstr "水面无土壤过程。该值是参考土壤过程速率的非负乘数（其他土地利用类别在 [0.1, 1.3] 内声明）；负因子会使过程反向，因此下界为 0。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
msgid "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.denitrification_rate`"
msgstr "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.denitrification_rate`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
