msgstr "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.erosion_rate`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
msgid "No erosion over water. An erosion rate (soil loss) cannot be negative; no physical upper limit is fixed, so the upper bound is open (inf)."
msgstr "水面无侵蚀。侵蚀速率（土壤流失）不能为负；未规定物理上限，因此上界开放（inf）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
msgid "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.infiltration_rate`"
msgstr "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.infiltration_rate`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
msgid "No infiltration over water. An infiltration rate into the soil cannot be negative; no physical upper limit is fixed, so the upper bound is open (inf)."
msgstr "水面无入渗。进入土壤的入渗速率不能为负；未规定物理上限，因此上界开放（inf）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
msgid "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.nitrification_rate`"
msgstr "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.nitrification_rate`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
