msgstr "`anthroposphere.land_use.soil.water.soil_carbon_input`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/anthroposphere.md:571
msgid "No soil carbon input over water. A soil carbon input flux (inputs only) cannot be negative; no physical upper limit is fixed, so the upper bound is open (inf)."
msgstr "水面无土壤碳输入。土壤碳输入通量（仅表示输入）不能为负；未规定物理上限，因此上界开放（inf）。"

